          "settings": {
            "html": "<!-- ============================================================\n  Google-Buchungsseite – KOPF (Elementor HTML-Widget, oberstes Widget)\n  Darunter folgt das Shortcode-Widget mit [ameliabooking].\n  Alle Klassen beginnen mit \"stg-\", damit nichts mit Theme/Kit kollidiert.\n  ============================================================ -->\n<style>\n  /* Seitenhintergrund (Elementor-Canvas-Seite hat sonst Weiß) */\n  body:has(.stg-page-marker){ background:#F7F1EA !important; }\n\n  .stg-w{ width:100%; max-width:760px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto; }\n\n  /* Karte um das Amelia-Formular (Shortcode-Widget trägt die Klasse stg-form) */\n  .stg-form{\n    margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:28px;\n    background:#fff; border-radius:16px; padding:8px;\n    box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(46,42,40,.06), 0 8px 28px rgba(46,42,40,.08);\n    min-height:320px;\n  }\n\n  .stg-head{ text-align:center; padding:28px 4px 8px; }\n  .stg-head .stg-brand{\n    display:inline-block; text-decoration:none !important;\n    font-family:\"Playfair Display\",Georgia,serif !important;\n    font-size:22px; letter-spacing:.04em; color:#2E2A28 !important;\n  }\n  .stg-head .stg-kicker{\n    margin:4px 0 0 !important; font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase;\n    color:#7A7A7A !important;\n  }\n  .stg-head h1{\n    margin:26px 0 10px !important;\n    font-family:\"Playfair Display\",Georgia,serif !important;\n    font-weight:500 !important; font-size:clamp(28px,6vw,40px) !important; line-height:1.15 !important;\n    color:#2E2A28 !important;\n  }\n  .stg-head .stg-lead{\n    margin:0 auto !important; max-width:520px;\n    font-size:16px !important; line-height:1.6 !important; color:#4A4442 !important;\n  }\n  .stg-head .stg-addr{\n    margin:14px 0 0 !important; font-size:14px !important; color:#7A7A7A !important;\n  }\n  .stg-rule{ width:48px; height:2px; margin:22px auto 0; background:#C8B178; border:0; }\n</style>\n\n<span class=\"stg-page-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n<header class=\"stg-head\">\n  <a class=\"stg-brand\" href=\"https://spiritual-touch.de/\">Spiritual Touch</a>\n  <p class=\"stg-kicker\">Tantramassage &amp; Körpertherapie · München</p>\n\n  <h1>Termin online buchen</h1>\n  <p class=\"stg-lead\">\n    Wähle dein Angebot, deine Begleitung und deinen Wunschtermin – in wenigen Schritten.\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"stg-addr\">Olschewskibogen 12 · 80935 München-Feldmoching-Hasenbergl</p>\n  <hr class=\"stg-rule\">\n</header>\n",
